id: capsule
name: Capsule
kind: gear
tags: tech
craftDC: Qualified
# It is a Capsule: it holds one Basic Item, and cannot be put inside another Capsule.
capsule: true
# "You can spend 1 Action to throw the Capsule."
placeCost: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Holds almost anything in a device small enough to carry. Throw it and what is inside
  appears.
text: >
  Capsule [Tech]: An item that can hold almost anything in it, keeping it in a compact, easy
  to carry device.
  –Craft DC: Qualified
  –Effects: You can store any Basic Item into a Capsule. Vehicles and Bases can also be
  stored within Capsules through the Capsule Quality. You cannot store a living thing or a
  Capsule within a Capsule.

  You can spend 1 Action to throw the Capsule into an unoccupied Square within a Destructive
  Sphere AoE (centered on you). If you do, and there’s enough space for the size of the item,
  it appears instantly in that position with its central occupied square (if possible – any
  Square of your choice, if not) being the Square you threw the Capsule to.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Store: one of the character's own Basic Items goes inside. It stays an Item of theirs -
# renamed, described, whatever it was - marked as held by this Capsule, and the Gear tab
# shows it on the Capsule's row instead of its own. "Any Basic Item", so Accessories too,
# which "are also counted as Basic Items for rules and effects"; never a Capsule.
#
# Throw: 1 Action, and what was inside is out again. Where it lands, whether there is room
# for it, and which Square is its centre are the table's. The Capsule stays, empty.
#
# One Item to a Capsule. The entry stores "any Basic Item into a Capsule" and throws the
# Capsule to make "it" appear - one thing in, one thing out.
#
# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# "Vehicles and Bases can also be stored within Capsules through the Capsule Quality." There
# are no Vehicles, Bases or Capsule Quality in this system yet. A living thing is not an Item
# here, so there is nothing to refuse.
